# Terminology compliance

Authoritative replacement table: **scope master §12** (`project_scope/scope_master_reconstruction_project.md`).

## Rules

- Use **entity**, **population dataset**, **participation rate**, **preference proxy**, **outcome event**, **survey measurement** / **measurement firm**, **program** — never banned alternatives in README, user-facing strings, comments that ship publicly, field names, or docs.

## Semantic clusters (narrative prose)

- Do not combine restricted concepts in the same paragraph per scope §12 semantic cluster rules.

## Enforcement before merge

- Grep or CI check when available; manual review for docs/dashboard copy.

## Module C

- **`election_date`** → **`outcome_event_date`**; calibration series **A | B** — never mix numerators/denominators across series.
